<view class="page">
  <view class="eyebrow">ABOUT</view>
  <view class="title">关于这间暗房</view>
  <view class="muted sub">小程序与网页共用同一套 PhotoMemory API，双端可上传、翻阅、分享。</view>

  <view class="card block">
    <view class="h">云端服务</view>
    <view class="muted">API：{{apiBase}}</view>
    <view class="muted">影帧：{{count}} · 约 {{bytes}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card block">
    <view class="h">使用说明</view>
    <view class="muted">1. 在 app.js 填写 apiBase / apiToken</view>
    <view class="muted">2. 服务端部署 server/ 并开启 HTTPS</view>
    <view class="muted">3. 小程序后台配置 request 合法域名</view>
    <view class="muted">4. 网页 js/config.js 填同一套地址与 Token</view>
  </view>

  <button class="btn-ghost" bindtap="refresh">刷新统计</button>
</view>
